description: Testing conventions for libqc
globs: ["__tests__/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

- Structure: __tests__/unit, __tests__/integration, __tests__/property
- Shared factories in __tests__/testUtils.ts
- Source-oriented names: {module}.test.ts
- Property tests for crypto encode/decode round-trips
- Mandatory coverage when touching: vault encryption, chain dispatch, validator config, transfers
- Storage mocking: in-memory LibQCStorage maps
- P11TODO markers = test opportunity beacons
